# ERROR CODE RULES — eProcure Enterprise

## 1. NAMING CONVENTION

```
Format:  {SERVICE_PREFIX}_{3-digit-number}
Example: PR_001, IAM_002, FIN_010

Prefix mapping:
  IAM_   → IAM Service         (001–099)
  PR_    → Purchase Request    (001–099)
  APR_   → Approval Engine     (001–099)
  FIN_   → Finance Service     (001–099)
  INV_   → Inventory Service   (001–099)
  VND_   → Vendor Service      (001–099)
  NTF_   → Notification        (001–099)
  GW_    → API Gateway         (001–099)
  SYS_   → System-wide         (001–099)
  VAL_   → Validation          (001–099)
```

